    <briefdescription>
<para>A simple adapter that combines incoming AV and PV requests into mixed requests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This adapter can be used to connect a TLM2_AV and/or TLM2_PV initiator to a TLM2_PV_AV target. It combines incoming AV and PV requests into one TLM2 socket request.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BUSWIDTH</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The width of the data bus in bits. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
